/E (I \( Parth Dwivedi \) declare that the work documented in this report represents the UI/UX design tasks completed during my UI/UX Product Design Internship. The report summarizes the design process, Figma work, prototype development, component creation, and developer handoff preparation carried out during the internship period.)
