/E (I would like to express my sincere gratitude to Just Internship for providing the opportunity to undertake the UI/UX Product Design Internship. The internship provided practical exposure to design-system creation, wireframing, component design, high-fidelity interface development, interactive prototyping, and developer handoff.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
