/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 91 0 R
/E (This report presents the work completed during a UI/UX Product Design Internship conducted from 30 August. Instead of a single named project, the internship consisted of seven structured design tasks covering the major stages of a modern UI/UX workflow.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
123 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 91 0 R
/E (The work began with the configuration of Figma workspaces, desktop frames, and an 8 point layout-grid foundation. A shared typography and color system was then developed, followed by low-fidelity wireframes for application pages. Reusable buttons and input components were created with multiple states, after which the interface was translated into a high-fidelity dashboard. The screens were subsequently connected through Figma's prototyping tools to simulate application navigation. Finally, a developer)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
124 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 91 0 R
/E (handoff specification sheet was prepared to document spacing, grids, typography, colors, components, and implementation guidance. The completed work demonstrates a progression from structural planning to visual design, interaction design, and implementation handoff. The internship strengthened practical skills in Figma operations,)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
